---
description: When doing advertising work with PaidSync in a folder that has a PAIDSYNC.md file, read it first and use its accounts, goals, markets and rules.
alwaysApply: false
---

If a `PAIDSYNC.md` file exists at the workspace root:

1. Read it before any PaidSync work.
2. Set the accounts it lists on each platform before reading or changing anything, and never act on an account it does not list without asking.
3. Judge performance against its goals (target CPA or ROAS, budget) and markets.
4. Follow its rules on top of PaidSync's own approval step.

If it does not exist and the user works with more than one brand, offer to create it with the `paidsync-brand-workspace` skill.
